    </credit>
  </info>

  <title>Loan payments report</title>

  <p>The <gui>Loan payments</gui> button of the <link
  xref="main_reports_window"/> opens this report. Choose one of the
  <gui>Loans</gui>, and its payments are listed with how much of each was
  principal and how much interest. Under <gui>Loan info</gui> are when it
  started, its payment period, the contact and liability account, the loan
  total, and the principal paid and unpaid, interest paid and whether it is
  <gui>Finished</gui>.</p>

  <p>To correct how a payment was split, check <gui>Edit mode</gui> in the
  window menu, which asks for the administrator password, then right click
  the payment and choose <gui>Edit principal</gui>.</p>

</page>
